ans-serif; font-size: 15pt;\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 15pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 15pt;\">본인확인</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 15pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 15pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 15pt;\">납부 당일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 15pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 15pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">17</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 15pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">시 이후</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 15pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 15pt;\">원스톱서비스에서 직접 확인</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: normal; margin-top: 3pt; margin-left: 19.1pt; padding-top: 0px; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all; text-indent: -19.1pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 15pt;\">4.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 15pt;\">주의사항</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 2pt; margin-left: 19pt; padding-top: 0px; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all; text-indent: -19pt;\"><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">&nbsp; 가. <b><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">기간 내 미납 시 별도 통보 없이 탈락 처리</span></b></span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 2pt; margin-left: 19pt; padding-top: 0px; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all; text-indent: -19pt;\"><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">&nbsp; 나. 운영 관련 상세사항은 선발 공고문 참고</span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 2pt; margin-left: 19pt; padding-top: 0px; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all; text-indent: -19pt;\"><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">&nbsp; 다. 입사일 이전에 <b>입사안내문</b>을 반드시 참고하여 입사</span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 2pt; margin-left: 19pt; padding-top: 0px; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all; text-indent: -19pt;\"><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">&nbsp; 라. 마스크 미착용자, 발열(37.5℃ 이상) 및 코로나19 감염증 유증상자는 입사불가</span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 2pt; margin-left: 19pt; padding-top: 0px; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all; text-indent: -19pt;\"><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">&nbsp; 마. 신속항원검사 또는 PCR검사 확인서 및 결핵진단서 결과 미제출자는 입사불가</span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 2pt; margin-left: 19pt; padding-top: 0px; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all; text-indent: -19pt;\"><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 20px;\"></span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 2pt; margin-left: 19pt; padding-top: 0px; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all; text-indent: -19pt;\"><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">&nbsp; 바. 하계방학 기간 <b>공용시설 미운영</b></span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: normal; margin-top: 3pt; margin-left: 19.1pt; paddin